// Secrets this project needs. `devkey need` reads this and reports what is
// missing plus the exact command to fix it. The values live in the machine's
// system keyring, never here.
//
//   devkey need                              what is missing right now
//   devkey run cloudflare -- npm run deploy  deploy with the token in env
//
// REFRESH_TOKEN is deliberately absent: it is a Worker secret set once with
// `wrangler secret put REFRESH_TOKEN` and stored by Cloudflare, so no local
// deploy needs it in the environment.
needs "cloudflare"
